        ['Vartan Avakian', 'فارطان اواكيان', 'Vartan Avakian is an artist working with video, photography and sculpture. His work explores data as stains and scratches — inscriptions fossilized over time — framing memory as an act of excavation and participation. He focuses on the preservation of visual and oral culture. His work has been exhibited internationally, and he engages in academic discussions on photography, memory and collecting practices. He is a board member of the Arab Image Foundation.                                                                    ', '<div>فنان يستخدم في ممارسته الفيديو والتصوير الفوتوغرافي والنحت. تستكشف أعماله البيانات كخدوش وبقع، كأنها نقوش متحجرة عبر الزمن، لتؤطر الذاكرة كفعل تنقيب ومشاركة. يركز في عمله على حفظ الثقافة البصرية والشفهية. عُرضت أعماله في محافل دولية، كما شارك في النقاشات الأكاديمية حول التصوير والذاكرة وممارسات التجميع. عضو مجلس إدارة المؤسسة العربية للصورة.</div><div><br></div>                                                                    ', '1'],
        ['Vikram Divesha', 'فيكرام ديفيشا', '', '', '1'],
        ['Visualizing Impact', 'تصوير التأثير', '<div>Visualizing Impact (VI) is a non-profit collective that uses data, design, and technology for human rights. Visualizing Palestine, the first and largest initiative of VI, advances a factual, rights-based narrative of the Palestinian-Israeli situation. VP\'s work is supported in part by a grassroots community of Members around the world. VI has also worked on topics such as refugee rights, youth unemployment, and digital rights.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div>                                                                                                                                        ', '                                                                                                                                        ', '1'],
